===Noun===
{{en-noun|~}}

# {{lb|en|uncountable|signal processing}} The [[process]] of [[approximating]] a [[continuous]] [[signal]] by a [[set]] of [[discrete]] [[symbol]]s or [[integer]] [[value]]s
# {{lb|en|countable|physics}} A [[procedure]] for [[constructing]] a [[quantum field theory]] starting from a [[classical field theory]]; to represent by [[quantum|quanta]]

